The '''Hot Springs''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|The fish here have evolved amongst the heat to not require any sunlight.|Fishing feels just as fast as on the surface!|Enjoy the soothing hot springs!}}
== Features ==
The '''Hot Springs''' allows players to fish up [[Sea Creatures#Winter|Winter Sea Creatures]] from {{Item|Water}}.

